WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.579
Let's build sentences, one step at a time.

2
00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.285
This is a simple sentence.

3
00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.217
It tells us WHO: the dog.

4
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.358
And WHAT they did: barked. That is the verb.

5
00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:29.491
Capital letter at the start. Full stop at the end.

6
00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:36.811
'Barked loudly.' is NOT a sentence. Who barked?

7
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.026
A sentence needs a WHO and a verb, and must make sense.

8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.276
We can JOIN two sentences together.

9
00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:51.403
Here are two simple sentences.

10
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.197
The word 'so' joins them. It is a connective.

11
00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.929
The full stop becomes a comma. 'The' becomes 'the'.

12
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.719
Use 'and', 'but' or 'so' to join ideas.

13
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.904
Change the joining word and the meaning changes too.

14
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.733
Some joining words add a reason or a time.

15
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.486
'We stayed inside' makes sense on its own.

16
00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:30.603
'because it was raining' tells us WHY.

17
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.922
But on its own, it does not make sense.

18
00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.708
Other words like this: when, although, if, after.

19
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.022
You can also swap the clauses around.

20
00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:53.126
If the extra clause comes first, add a comma.

21
00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.676
Finally, add detail to make it more interesting.

22
00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.117
Add an adjective: scruffy.

23
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.550
Add an adverb: loudly.

24
00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.680
Add where or who: at the postman.

25
00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:20.175
Same sentence. Much more detail!

26
00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:23.978
Your turn! Pause the video.

27
00:02:35.967 --> 00:02:38.243
Either answer works. Did you get one?

28
00:02:44.733 --> 00:02:47.659
Start simple. Then join, then add detail.
